      "content": "Here are two distinct personas for your product launch.\n\n**Luxury Skincare Persona:** Meet \"Eleanor,\" a successful Marketing Director in her late 30s, who values quality and self-care, having a sophisticated, urban lifestyle. She is interested in wellness retreats, fine dining, and clean beauty trends, often gravitating towards global cultures for inspiration. Her disposable income allows her to invest heavily in premium, scientifically backed beauty solutions.\n\n**Budget Cleaning Persona:** Meet \"Marco,\" a hardworking Small Business Owner in his early 50s, who maintains a busy, pragmatic household life focused on efficiency. He is highly interested in value, practical budgeting tips, and home improvement projects. Marco is very community-oriented and prefers straightforward, reliable products to minimize overhead costs.",
